<mxCell id="input-fullthreats-panel" parent="Zaoj7bLlvR61uXWHlQDn-4" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=6;fillColor=#CCCCCC;align=left;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;verticalAlign=middle;" value="&lt;div align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;Full_Threats input features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;For each (non-king) piece-to-(non-king) piece attack on the board, activate a feature indexed by the attacking piece, the attacked piece, and the square of both pieces.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="120" as="geometry" x="0"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="input-pp3wide-panel" parent="Zaoj7bLlvR61uXWHlQDn-4" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=6;fillColor=#CCCCCC;align=left;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;verticalAlign=middle;" value="&lt;div align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;PP_3Wide input features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;For each pair of pawns on the board on the same or adjacent files, activate a feature indexed by their two colors and squares.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="120" height="80" width="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="input-halfka-panel" parent="Zaoj7bLlvR61uXWHlQDn-4" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=6;fillColor=#CCCCCC;align=left;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;verticalAlign=middle;" value="&lt;div align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;HalfKAv2_hm input features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;For each piece on the board, with locations adjusted for the given perspective (flip), activate a feature indexed by:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. KSqH[32] - our king's square mapped (mirrored) to half of the board such that A1 == H1&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. PcSq[64] - square the piece is on&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. PcK[11] - essentially piece.type * 2 + piece.is_our; map kings to single index&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="230" height="80" width="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
